OL,3,AOvernight curfews announced in parts of
OL,4,AParis and Nice after riots across
OL,5,AFrance
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice announce overnight curfews in
OL,8,Fparts of central Paris and other cities
OL,9,Ffollowing riots across France
OL,11,FIn the capital, the curfew is due to
OL,12,Fcome into force from 23:00 local time
OL,13,F(22:00 BST) and last until 06:00 -
OL,14,Fhere's more from the statement
OL,16,FThe mayor of Nice, in southern France,
OL,17,Fimposes a curfew specifically for young
OL,18,Fpeople. There are also restrictions in
OL,19,Fthe southern city of Lyon and northern
OL,20,Fcities, including Lille
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
