OL,3,AOvernight curfews announced in parts of
OL,4,AParis and Nice after riots across
OL,5,AFrance
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier, French PM Sebastien Lecornu
OL,8,Fgave local authorities the power to
OL,9,Fimpose such curfews after a weekend of
OL,10,Friots and looting - some 2,000
OL,11,Fbusinesses are thought to have been
OL,12,Fimpacted
OL,14,FIn a statement, he said: "We will not
OL,15,Fbe dictated and ruled by the breakers,
OL,16,Fby the thieves, by the thugs"
OL,18,FThe disorder began last month with
OL,19,Fstudents protesting over school
OL,20,Fconditions, but have since escalated to
OL,21,Ftake in a broader range of concerns
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
